"IPv6. About two thirds of the fleet qualifies, and some countries "
"have none — if your locations have none, the VPN will not connect "
"rather than quietly give you a gateway without IPv6."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:2412
msgid ""
