"this mode."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:2413
msgid ""
"No Tor gateway forwards IPv6, so this cannot be applied in this "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:2415
msgid ""
"Needs the Automatic IPv6 mode — in Block and Off, IPv6 is not routed "
"whichever gateway is picked."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:2430
