"They do forward IPv6, so this may simply work on the next attempt — "
"reconnect rather than changing the locations."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:593
msgid "IPv6 required — the pinned server does not support it"
msgstr ""

