msgid ""
"The pinned server does not forward IPv6 and this instance requires "
"it. Pick a different server, or turn the requirement off."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:598
