msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-protonvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/protonvpn/overview.js:599
msgid ""
"This instance requires IPv6 and no gateway providing it is "
"available, so the tunnel stays down."
msgstr ""

